      "canonicalScene": 12,
      "kind": "unlabelled-song",
      "openingLineTa": "பூமாலே நீயே புழுதி மண்மேலே வீணே",
      "lyricistTa": "மு. கருணாநிதி",
      "evidenceBasis": "anthology-attributed",
      "evidenceReference": "works/kalaignar-thirai-isai-paadalgal/songs/song-003.md (kalaignar-song-003, anthology song 3, lyric PDF 30); anthology contents PDF 28 lists `பூமாலை நீயே` beside `கலைஞர்`. Cross-witness comparison: songs/match-report-004-poomaalai-neeye.md",
      "performanceContext": "Kalyani sings while holding her child.",
      "reprisesId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-song-005",
      "canonicalScene": 15,
      "kind": "unlabelled-song",
      "openingLineTa": "தேசம், ஞானம், கல்வி, ஈசன் பூசையெல்லாம்",
